{
    "title": "QDOBA Mexican Eats",
    "description": "At QDOBA, our mission is to bring flavor to people\u2019s lives. Crave it? The app\u2019s got it. Download the app for the easiest, fastest way to order (and re-order!) your faves. Order ahead for convenient pickup and delivery. \r\n\r\nFlavorful Rewards as Easy as One, Two, FREE:\r\n\r\nJoin QDOBA Rewards and earn points toward free food every time you order. Order online or scan your QDOBA Rewards barcode at checkout with the app or from your phone\u2019s virtual wallet.\r\n\r\nFeatures: \r\n- Order and pay ahead for delivery or pickup on all your mexican eat favorites like tacos, burritos, quesadillas, nachos, bowls and more.\r\n- Save your favorite location or find a QDOBA restaurant closest to you. \r\n- Review past orders and save favorite menu items for easy online ordering.\r\n- Track your order seamlessly on the app to know when it\u2019s ready for pickup or being delivered.\r\n- Earn points on every qualifying order so your tacos can earn you more tacos.\r\n- Redeem exclusive rewards and special offers only available on the app.\r\n- Add queso and guac for free on any entr\u00e9e!",
    "descriptionHTML": "At QDOBA, our mission is to bring flavor to people\u2019s lives. Crave it? The app\u2019s got it. Download the app for the easiest, fastest way to order (and re-order!) your faves. Order ahead for convenient pickup and delivery. <br><br>Flavorful Rewards as Easy as One, Two, FREE:<br><br>Join QDOBA Rewards and earn points toward free food every time you order. Order online or scan your QDOBA Rewards barcode at checkout with the app or from your phone\u2019s virtual wallet.<br><br>Features: <br>- Order and pay ahead for delivery or pickup on all your mexican eat favorites like tacos, burritos, quesadillas, nachos, bowls and more.<br>- Save your favorite location or find a QDOBA restaurant closest to you. <br>- Review past orders and save favorite menu items for easy online ordering.<br>- Track your order seamlessly on the app to know when it\u2019s ready for pickup or being delivered.<br>- Earn points on every qualifying order so your tacos can earn you more tacos.<br>- Redeem exclusive rewards and special offers only available on the app.<br>- Add queso and guac for free on any entr\u00e9e!",
